WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.432
Step 1. Open the Actions page.

1.2
00:00:02.432 --> 00:00:08.470
Care runs an action configuration every time staff book an appointment from a slot,

1.3
00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:14.365
in any facility. Select Admin Dashboard, then Actions under Configuration.

2.1
00:00:14.365 --> 00:00:19.512
Step 2. Start a new configuration. Select New action configuration.

2.2
00:00:19.512 --> 00:00:24.938
Care opens the details of the configuration and an Actions section.

3.1
00:00:24.938 --> 00:00:30.454
Step 3. Fill in the details. Name is required and Description is optional.

3.2
00:00:30.454 --> 00:00:33.585
Appointments is the only choice in Runs for,

3.3
00:00:33.585 --> 00:00:37.691
and you cannot change it after you save.

4.1
00:00:37.691 --> 00:00:42.212
Step 4. Add an action. Under Actions, select Add action.

4.2
00:00:42.212 --> 00:00:48.917
Until you add a condition, the action runs for every appointment that staff book.

5.1
00:00:48.917 --> 00:00:51.017
Step 5. Add conditions.

5.2
00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:56.002
Select Add a condition, then choose a patient detail in Field,

5.3
00:00:56.002 --> 00:01:01.842
an Operator such as Greater Than or Equal, and a Value.

6.1
00:01:01.842 --> 00:01:03.854
Step 6. Add instructions.

6.2
00:01:03.854 --> 00:01:08.154
Under Then, select Add instruction and choose an Instruction.

6.3
00:01:08.154 --> 00:01:14.108
Show a message shows your text to the staff member who books the appointment.

7.1
00:01:14.108 --> 00:01:17.647
Step 7. Save the configuration. Select Save.

7.2
00:01:17.647 --> 00:01:22.955
Care shows Action configuration created, goes back to the Actions page,

7.3
00:01:22.955 --> 00:01:27.964
and runs the configuration each time staff book from a slot.
